{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "karlopay-webhook-collection",
		"name": "KarloPay - Webhook de Confirmación de Pago",
		"description": "Colección para probar el webhook de confirmación de pago de KarloPay. Incluye ejemplos con el payload completo y diferentes escenarios de seguridad.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Webhook - Confirmación de Pago (Payload Completo)",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"exec": [
							"pm.test(\"Status code es 200\", function () {",
							"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
							"});",
							"",
							"pm.test(\"Respuesta exitosa\", function () {",
							"    const response = pm.response.json();",
							"    pm.expect(response).to.have.property('success');",
							"    pm.expect(response.success).to.be.true;",
							"    pm.expect(response).to.have.property('message');",
							"});",
							"",
							"console.log(\"✅ Webhook procesado exitosamente\");"
						],
						"type": "text/javascript"
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "Content-Type",
						"value": "application/json"
					},
					{
						"key": "X-Karlopay-Signature",
						"value": "{{webhook_signature}}",
						"type": "text",
						"disabled": true,
						"description": "Firma del webhook (opcional, solo si KARLOPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET está configurado)"
					},
					{
						"key": "X-Forwarded-For",
						"value": "{{karlopay_ip}}",
						"type": "text",
						"disabled": true,
						"description": "IP de KarloPay (para testing, solo si KARLOPAY_WEBHOOK_ALLOWED_IPS está configurado)"
					}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "raw",
					"raw": "{\n  \"numberOfOrder\": \"HXYHR3WL\",\n  \"cardType\": \"CREDIT MASTERCARD\",\n  \"paymentDate\": \"2026-02-27T13:44:16\",\n  \"cardDC\": \"mastercard\",\n  \"bankName\": \"n/a\",\n  \"bankCode\": \"999\",\n  \"referenceNumber\": null,\n  \"cardHolder\": null,\n  \"postalCode\": \"63915\",\n  \"meses\": 0,\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"PUE\",\n  \"paymentForm\": \"04\",\n  \"promotion\": false,\n  \"taxData\": {\n    \"socialReason\": \"zuriel test\",\n    \"postalCodeTax\": \"63915\",\n    \"RFC\": \"XAXX010101000\",\n    \"taxRegime\": \"616\",\n    \"CFDI\": \"S01\",\n    \"email\": \"zuriel@karlo.io\"\n  },\n  \"paymentInformation\": {\n    \"percentageBaseComission\": 0.0175,\n    \"percentageBaseSurcharge\": 0,\n    \"commissions\": {\n      \"baseComission\": 211.83,\n      \"baseComissionIva\": 33.89,\n      \"baseComissionTotal\": 245.72\n    },\n    \"surcharges\": {\n      \"baseSurcharge\": 0,\n      \"baseSurchargeIva\": 0,\n      \"baseSurchargeTotal\": 0\n    },\n    \"originalAmount\": 12001,\n    \"totalCommissionForTerminalUse\": 103.62,\n    \"totalCommissionForDeferringToMonths\": 0,\n    \"totalCommissionToCustomer\": 103.62,\n    \"totalCommissionToBusiness\": 245.72,\n    \"totalToDepositBusiness\": 11858.9,\n    \"totalPaymentPerMonth\": 12104.62,\n    \"totalPayment\": 12104.62\n  },\n  \"additional\": {\n    \"session_id\": \"HXYHR3WL\",\n    \"order_group_id\": \"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001\"\n  }\n}"
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/payments/karlopay/webhook/payment",
					"host": [
						"{{base_url}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"api",
						"payments",
						"karlopay",
						"webhook",
						"payment"
					]
				},
				"description": "Webhook de confirmación de pago con el payload completo proporcionado por KarloPay. Este es el formato real que se envía cuando un pago se completa exitosamente.\n\n**Notas:**\n- El `numberOfOrder` debe coincidir con el guardado en `payment_transactions.external_reference`\n- Si `KARLOPAY_WEBHOOK_ALLOWED_IPS` está configurado, solo se permiten IPs de esa lista\n- Si `KARLOPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET` está configurado, se valida la firma del webhook\n- El campo `additional.order_group_id` ayuda a encontrar las órdenes relacionadas"
			},
			"response": []
		},
		{
			"name": "2. Webhook - Pago Mínimo (Solo Campos Requeridos)",
			"event": [
